      "commit": "2e6d1fd289eda4230cb1d031e2ea71489357b868",
      "unverifiedByTheConsumer": "A consumer's own controller is held against its own implementation by a parity test. This one is not held against anything: it arrived with the upload. A consumer that runs it should say so where the person can see it."
